BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jack London&rsquo\;s Medicine Case: The Drugs He Used in His Life 
 and Literature
DTSTART:20260806T110000
DTEND:20260806T110000
UID:f91d6ba46492648dd9e8f8eb2a503232@sonomavalleyevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Step inside the House of Happy Walls Museum for a fascinating 
 exploration of Jack London&rsquo\;s personal medicine case and the remarka
 ble story it reveals about his life\, health\, and writing. Dating from 19
 09&ndash\;1910\, the black leather Squibb medicine case on display in the 
 museum contains 22 glass vials with metal screw caps and drugs mostly in t
 ablet form. The drugs in the case include various opioid and non-opioid an
 algesics\, antipyretics (fever reducers)\, anti-inflammatories\, drugs for
  r
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park2400 London Ranch Rd Glen Ellen\, 
 CA 95442
URL:https://www.sonomavalleyevents.com/08/06/2026/jack-london-s-medicine-c
 ase-the-drugs-he-used-in-his-life-and-literature/
X-SOURCE:Sonoma Valley Events
END:VEVENT
